### X webhook + decision log.

@pageSize = 20

### Backend health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Register the webhook with X (the mock in dev). Idempotent.
# The mock runs a CRC check against X_WEBHOOK_TARGET_URL, so the response's
# `valid` flag shows whether the backend answered the challenge.
# Mock state is in memory: re-run this after x-api-mock restarts.
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/x/registration

### CRC challenge (what X calls to validate the webhook)
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/x?crc_token=manual-test-token

### Decision log (offset pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/x/decisions?limit={{pageSize}}&offset=0

### Decision log for one post — set postId to a platform post id
@postId = replace-with-post-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/x/decisions?platformPostId={{postId}}&limit={{pageSize}}&offset=0
